    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_ZOM_OBSERVER_NAME">
      <Text>Observer</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_ZOM_OBSERVER_DESCRIPTION">
      <Text>Watch the game without playing. The Observer has no abilities, founds no settlement and sees the whole map. Pair with the Observer civilization.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_ZOM_OBSERVER_QUOTE">
      <Text>"To see everything, hold nothing."</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LOADING_LEADER_INTRO_TEXT_ZOM_OBSERVER">
      <Text>You are here to watch. Added by Zatygold's Observer Mode.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_ZOM_OBSERVER_LEADER_NAME">
      <Text>All-Seeing</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_ZOM_OBSERVER_LEADER_DESCRIPTION">
      <Text>Never eliminated for having no settlements.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_ZOM_OBSERVER_NAME">
      <Text>Observer</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_ZOM_OBSERVER_FULLNAME">
      <Text>Observer</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_ZOM_OBSERVER_ADJECTIVE">
      <Text>Observer</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_ZOM_OBSERVER_DESCRIPTION">
      <Text>A civilization that never settles. In place of a Founder it starts with the Observer's Eye, which sees every plot and every unit. Added by Zatygold's Observer Mode.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LOADING_CIV_INTRO_TEXT_ZOM_OBSERVER">
      <Text>No cities, no score - only the view.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_CITY_NAME_ZOM_OBSERVER1">
      <Text>Overlook</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_ZOM_OBSERVER_NAME">
      <Text>Spectator</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_ZOM_OBSERVER_DESCRIPTION">
      <Text>Starts with the Observer's Eye in place of a Founder. No bonuses.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_ZOM_OBSERVER_EYE_NAME">
      <Text>Observer's Eye</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_ZOM_OBSERVER_EYE_DESCRIPTION">
      <Text>Sees the whole map through terrain and vegetation, and keeps every unit in sight. Hidden from other players; cannot found a city or be damaged.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNLOCK_PLAY_AS_ZOM_OBSERVER_DESCRIPTION">
      <Text>Play as [B]Observer[/B].</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNLOCK_PLAY_AS_ZOM_OBSERVER_TOOLTIP">
      <Text>The [B]Observer[/B] watches as the [B]Observer[/B] civilization in every Age.</Text>
